:"Coprolalia: Sexual arousal caused by saying and hearing obscene words."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"After losing both parents and inheriting a fortune, she lost the warmth of loved ones and any need to strive for anything."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Being so young, she can start over as many times as she wants. Now she can live both supported by her new friends and for the sake of helping them in return."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on the in-game profile"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her real name is Hashiba Mikio (羽柴 美希緒). Himea calls her Mikki (ミッキー)."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Draco is actually a stuffed toy and a memento from her now deceased mother. She does ventriloquism to make it look like he can actually speak."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c93367"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"漫画やアニメやネットゲームにはまり、中二病をこじらせている少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"隣には常に使い魔のドラコリアスが付き従っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22922","sourceWorkId":"29963","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"漫画やアニメやネットゲームにはまり、中二病をこじらせている少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"隣には常に使い魔のドラコリアスが付き従っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"89505"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3e/3e982462b54cecfdb700ff1f9598c86608fc180f4de826b633d966419b115c0a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ed/edf0539e6a0fbb5a1591bc103dc433196ddb78b811cc9b56c2f58f5e5f1beba3.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"民安ともえ","creatorId":"vndb:s23","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s23","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s23","name":"民安 ともえ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:314782:89505:5900:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c93368","characterName":"エルスティン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"89506","match":"exact-normalized-n